<title>USA: China buys 20,000 tonnes of U.S soyoil - exporters.</title>
<headline>China buys 20,000 tonnes of U.S soyoil - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has bought 20,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean oil for shipment on October 24, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The oil was reportedly to be shipped on the Blue Sapphire. Port details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>One exporter noted there was also talk China could have made additional purchases, possibly bringing Thursday's total purchase to as much as 70,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Anna Driver 312-408 8720</p>
